    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reeba, nintuma maraika okukwebembera, n'okukurinda omu muhanda, akakuhitsya omu mwanya ogu naakuteekateekyeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 4:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 5:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omworobere, ohurire eiraka rye, otamugwisa kubi; ahakuba tarisaasira bicumuro byanyu; ahabw'okuba eiziina ryangye riri omuriwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku orihurira eiraka rye, otaireho omutima, waakora byona ebi ndikugamba, obwo ndyaba omuzigu w'abazigu baawe, n'omubisha w'ababisha baawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 24:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba maraika wangye aryakwebembera, akuhitsye omu Baamori, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abanyakanaani, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi, mbamareho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otariramya baaruhanga baabo, otaribaheereza, n'obu kwakuba okutwaza nkabo; kureka oryabahwerekyerereza kimwe, n'enyomyo zaabo ez'amabaare ozisheenyagure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 7:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Muryaheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nawe aryaha eby'okurya byawe n'amaizi gaawe omugisha; kandi ndyaiha endwara omuriimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tihaine orirugwamu enda, nari oriba engumba omu nsi yaawe; kandi ndyahitsya omubaro gw'ebiro byawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
